itch modes. Spread modifiers, infinite ammo, and hitbox extenders. Automatic client anticheat bypass for movement and part checks.\nEurophium HVH Features\nForce hit using event hook methods to redirect shots. No spread exploit using math random hooking for perfect accuracy. Customizable hit parts including head and torso.\nSultanisimus HVH Features\nFast kill all exploit that targets every player in the lobby. Auto heal which teleports healing parts directly to your character.\nGeneral Features\nFatality UI with a smooth loader. Support for custom chat prefixes and colors. Built-in rejoin on kick system. Compatibility checker to ensure your executor supports the required functions.\nThis is a community project and the source code is available on GitHub. Join our discord for support and to follow the development progress.\n\n-# Srry for ai above, i was lazy to write allat","tags":["Penablox","HvH","Hacker vs Hacker","Open Source","OS"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/sMv9YeXbYR","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"68ea1c160f770d559a3b9055","username":"Eploit","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0c1809c5bf4ea956830ccf9c42705f1604d86739884fdf0990961e5dcb38ed63.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68ea1c160f770d559a3b9055-1760173121639.jpeg"},"status":"offline","id":"68ea1c160f770d559a3b9055","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0c1809c5bf4ea956830ccf9c42705f1604d86739884fdf0990961e5dcb38ed63.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68ea1c160f770d559a3b9055-1760173121639.jpeg"}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueHero","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-15T15:28:26.480Z","profile":"/u/QueueHero"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-23T02:31:32.192Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":true,"supportedGame